=== NAME  chainsaw/rwo-pvc-migration
    sink.go:61: | 12:48:10 | rwo-pvc-migration | 04-reader-pod    | ASSERT    | DONE  | v1/Pod @ chainsaw-improved-foxhound/reader-pod
    sink.go:61: | 12:48:10 | rwo-pvc-migration | 04-reader-pod    | CMD       | RUN   |
        === COMMAND
        /bin/bash -c # The migration this test is named for: the reader mounted the
        # volume on another node than the one that wrote it.
        w=$(kubectl -n "$NAMESPACE" get configmap writer-node -o jsonpath='{.data.node}')
        r=$(kubectl -n "$NAMESPACE" get pod reader-pod -o jsonpath='{.spec.nodeName}')
        echo "writer ran on $w, reader on $r"
        test -n "$r" && test "$w" != "$r"
